*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% HP KE200 thermal label printer (Bixolon SLCS), for use with the
*% rastertohplabel filter on Linux/CUPS.
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "HPKE200.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*Product: "(HP KE200)"
*ModelName: "HP KE200"
*ShortNickName: "HP KE200"
*NickName: "HP KE200 Label Printer (SLCS)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:HP;CMD:Bixolon_01;MODEL:KE200;CLASS:PRINTER;DES:HP KE200;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertohplabel"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w288h432
*PageSize w288h432/4 x 6 in: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w288h288/4 x 4 in: "<</PageSize[288 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w144h288/2 x 4 in: "<</PageSize[144 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w288h432
*PageRegion w288h432/4 x 6 in: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w288h288/4 x 4 in: "<</PageSize[288 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w144h288/2 x 4 in: "<</PageSize[144 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w288h432
*ImageableArea w288h432: "0 0 288 432"
*ImageableArea w288h288: "0 0 288 288"
*ImageableArea w144h288: "0 0 144 288"
*DefaultPaperDimension: w288h432
*PaperDimension w288h432: "288 432"
*PaperDimension w288h288: "288 288"
*PaperDimension w144h288: "144 288"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 DPI: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *Darkness/Darkness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: 14
*Darkness 8/8 (Lighter): ""
*Darkness 10/10: ""
*Darkness 12/12: ""
*Darkness 14/14 (Default): ""
*Darkness 16/16: ""
*Darkness 18/18: ""
*Darkness 20/20 (Darkest): ""
*CloseUI: *Darkness

*OpenUI *PrintSpeed/Print Speed: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PrintSpeed
*DefaultPrintSpeed: 4
*PrintSpeed 1/3 in/sec: ""
*PrintSpeed 2/4 in/sec: ""
*PrintSpeed 3/5 in/sec: ""
*PrintSpeed 4/6 in/sec (Default): ""
*PrintSpeed 5/7 in/sec: ""
*CloseUI: *PrintSpeed

*OpenUI *SensorType/Media Sensor: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *SensorType
*DefaultSensorType: 0Gap
*SensorType 0Gap/Gap (die-cut labels): ""
*SensorType 1Continuous/Continuous: ""
*SensorType 2Blackmark/Black Mark: ""
*CloseUI: *SensorType
